# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — 图像库按官方 CI 变体声明上游格式覆盖（AVIF/JXL 排除）═══
# Timestamp: 2026-08-22
# Software: SDL2_image 2.6.0 (SDL_image)
# Gate: authoritative CI round-6 FULL_PASS (upstream testimage 742/742, Skipped=0)
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id:                     E417
trigger_tool:           ctest|testimage|upstream-test|autotools
phase:                  testing|declaration
error_signature:        Format AVIF is not supported|Format JXL is not supported|SKIP: Recognising TGA by magic number is not supported|Assert Summary: Total=742
severity:               2
category:               testing, ci-variant, declaration, format-coverage, image
match_keywords:         AVIF, JXL, #if 0, 19 有效格式, formats[], testimage, Autotools CI, CMake CI, not supported, TGA SKIP, SDLTest_Log, assertion, testimage, 742, Skipped=0
title:                  图像库按官方 CI 变体声明上游格式覆盖（Autotools CI 口径 AVIF=0/JXL=0）

root_cause:             图像库上游测试按 CI 变体声明格式覆盖：SDL_image 2.6.0 test/main.c formats[] 共 21 条目，LBM/XV 为 #if 0 → 19 个有效格式；官方 CI main.yml 分变体（Autotools 变体 AVIF=0、JXL=0；CMake 变体 JXL=1），本配方按 Autotools 变体构建（AVIF/JXL 后端不编译）。testimage 遍历 19 格式：17 行 "Testing ability to load format" + AVIF/JXL 两处 "Format ... is not supported"；TGA "SKIP:" 是 SDLTest_Log 信息日志（main.c 925 行），非测试跳过。
affected_scope:         含可选格式/编解码后端（AVIF/JXL/WebP 等）的图像类库的测试声明与 PR 报告口径。
verification_cmd:       grep -c "Testing ability to load format" upstream-test.log（=17）+ grep "Format AVIF is not supported" "Format JXL is not supported"（=2）→ 19 格式全遍历；grep "Assert Summary"（742/742）；grep "Suite/Run Summary"（Skipped=0）；上游 test/CMakeLists.txt add_test NAME testimage → CTest 总量 1。
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           declare-format-coverage-by-ci-variant
rec_description:        PR/MANIFEST 按官方 Autotools CI 变体口径如实声明：formats[] 21-2(#if0)=19 有效格式、17 主动加载 + AVIF/JXL 按 "not supported" 报告、TGA "SKIP:" 为 SDLTest_Log 信息日志非测试跳过、断言 742/742、Skipped=0。不得把"不支持"写成"跳过"或夸大覆盖数。
rec_command:            ctest --output-on-failure（build() 内 testimage）
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-declaration

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      declare-gap-honestly
fallback_description:   若无法按官方变体全量运行，如实写 N/A/部分统计，禁止子集冒充全量。
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
forbid_1_pattern:       AVIF.*skipped|JXL.*skipped|遍历 18 种|19.*全.*支持
forbid_1_reason:        RV-001 已披露 MANIFEST.yml:20 误写"遍历 18 种"（实为 19）；AVIF/JXL 是 not supported 非跳过。
forbid_1_consequence:   声明口径失真，Web Review 判定精度问题。
forbid_2_pattern:       ctest -E.*|exclude.*testimage|只跑.*子集.*全量
forbid_2_reason:        禁止整目录/整套件/整标签 skip/exclude/disable；上游测试总量 1 需全量执行。
forbid_2_consequence:   伪造全量通过或子集冒充全量。

